From 719f66459c93f7ed3d76c88e5db25d5d2b5362a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Inboard Project <comrade@5160.local>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:03:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add hosted LUNs behind one SCSI ID (EnableLUNs)

With [SCSI] EnableLUNs=1, an image named HD51_... answers as LUN 1 of ID 5.
Each hosted LUN takes a spare device slot that is never selected on the
bus, so all existing device handlers run unchanged. Off by default.
